<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Receipt - Budz Reserve</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: white;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .success-icon {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 64px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .payment-info {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .amount {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #28a745;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #d4edda;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .booking-details {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196F3;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .details-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1976d2;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .details-item {
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #bbdefb;
        }
        .details-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .thank-you {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 class="logo">🏸 Budz Reserve</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Badminton Court Booking System</p>
        </div>

        <div class="success-icon">✅</div>

        <p class="greeting">Hello <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,</p>
        
        <div class="thank-you">Thank You for Your Booking!</div>
        
        <p>Your payment has been successfully processed. Here's your booking receipt:</p>

        <div class="payment-info">
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Payment Method:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{paymentMethod}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Reference Number:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{referenceNumber}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Transaction ID:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{transactionId}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Payment Date:</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{paymentDate}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="amount">₱ {{totalAmount}}</div>

        <div class="booking-details">
            <div class="details-title">📅 Booking Details</div>
            {{#if courtName}}
            <div class="details-item">
                <strong>Court:</strong> {{courtName}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            <div class="details-item">
                <strong>Date:</strong> {{bookingDate}}
            </div>
            <div class="details-item">
                <strong>Time:</strong> {{startTime}} - {{endTime}}
            </div>
            {{#if equipment}}
            <div class="details-item">
                <strong>Equipment:</strong> {{equipment}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffeaa7; color: #856404; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
            <strong>⚠️ Important Reminders:</strong>
            <ul style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Please arrive 15 minutes before your scheduled time</li>
                <li>Bring a valid ID for verification</li>
                <li>No cancellations or refunds once reservation is made</li>
                <li>Keep this receipt for your records</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p>We look forward to seeing you at the court! 🏸</p>

        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>Budz Reserve - Badminton Court Booking</strong></p>
            <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
            <p>© 2024 Budz Reserve. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

